+In a locked-down in-cluster connector, set `KUBECTL_ATE_CA_FILE` to a mounted
+PEM trust bundle, pass `--endpoint` and `--token-file`, and grant the pod no
+Kubernetes API permissions. The CA-file mode is used only with a direct
+endpoint and an explicit token file; it bypasses kubeconfig, port-forwarding,
+ClusterTrustBundle discovery, and implicit ServiceAccount token creation.
+
